    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "A research briefing focused on groundwater storage in California.  There is no single solution to increase the resilience of California’s water system to manage climatic change and increased growth. Nevertheless, finding ways to store water during wet years, so that it is available during dry periods, is important for California if it is to increase its drought resiliency.",
